        "original_id": "cb7e7016-0175-5ede-a8cc-5ad2bcf1e8d1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carlo Buccirosso, Paolo Sorrentino\n- Works: The Great Beauty, Il divo, Un'estate ai Caraibi, Un ciclone in famiglia\n- Places: Naples, Italy, Cannes Film Festival\n- Topics: Italian film, acting, directing, comedy\n\nFacts:\n- Carlo Buccirosso was born on 1 May 1954 in Naples, Italy.\n- Carlo Buccirosso is an Italian actor, film director, and comedian.\n- Carlo Buccirosso is known for roles in Un ciclone in famiglia from 2006 to 2008, Il divo in 2008, Un'estate ai Caraibi in 2009, and The Great Beauty in 2013.\n- The Great Beauty is a 2013 Italian art drama film.\n- Paolo Sorrentino co-wrote and directed The Great Beauty.\n- The Great Beauty premiered at the 2013 Cannes Film Festival.\n- The Great Beauty was screened in competition for the Palme d'Or at the 2013 Cannes Film Festival.",
